@startuml auth-register

title Auth - OTP 驗證 & 註冊流程

actor User
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "Handler /\nService" as Handler
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "Kafka /\nEmail" as Kafka

== Send OTP ==

User -> API : POST /auth/send-otp\n{ email }
API -> Handler : SendOtpCommand
Handler -> Handler : Validate\n(email format)
Handler -> DB : FindByEmailAsync(email)
alt Email 已存在
  Handler --> API : 400 email_conflict
end
Handler -> Redis : GET otp:{email}
alt OTP 尚未過期
  Handler --> API : 400 otp_not_expired
end
Handler -> Redis : GET otp:count:{email}:{yyyyMMdd}
alt 今日發送次數 >= 3
  Handler --> API : 400 otp_limit_exceeded
end
Handler -> Handler : 產生 6 位數 OTP
Handler -> Redis : SET otp:{email} = otp\n(TTL 10 分鐘)
Handler -> Redis : SET otp:count:{email}:{yyyyMMdd} = count+1\n(TTL 到今天 UTC 午夜)
Handler -> DB : AddAsync(OutboxEvent: auth.otp) + SaveChanges
note right: Kafka consumer 收到後寄驗證信
Handler --> API : 200

== Register ==

User -> API : POST /auth/register\n{ name, email, otp, password }
API -> Handler : RegisterUserCommand
Handler -> Handler : Validate\n(name, email format, password min 8, otp not empty)
Handler -> Redis : GET otp:{email}
alt OTP 不存在或不符
  Handler --> API : 400 otp_invalid
end
Handler -> DB : FindByEmailAsync(email)
alt Email 已存在
  Handler --> API : 400 email_conflict
end
Handler -> Handler : User.Create(name, email)\nuser.AddAuthProvider(Local, hash=bcrypt(password))
Handler -> DB : AddAsync(user)
Handler -> Redis : DEL otp:{email}
Handler -> DB : SaveChanges
Handler --> API : 201 { userId, email, createdAt }

@enduml
